{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "granthId": "dasam",
  "ang": 192,
  "lineCount": 48,
  "source": "BaniDB",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਚਨ ਸੁਨਤ ਸੁਰਪੁਰਿ ਥਰਹਰਾ ॥੪॥",
      "transliteration": "bachan sunat surapur tharaharaa ||4||",
      "translation": "“You should then began the performance of a Yajna, and hearing about it , the people of the region of gods became fearful.4.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਯੱਗ ਦੀ) ਗੱਲ ਸੁਣ ਕੇ ਦੇਵਪੁਰੀ ਕੰਬ ਗਈ ॥੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बचन सुनत सुरपुरि थरहरा ॥४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83315",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਸਨੁ ਬੋਲ ਕਰਿ ਕਰੋ ਬਿਚਾਰਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bisan bol kar karo bichaaraa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੇ (ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ) ਬੁਲਾ ਕੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਕਿਹਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिसनु बोल करि करो बिचारा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83316",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਬ ਕਛੁ ਕਰੋ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਅਸੁਰਾਰਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ab kachh karo ma(n)tr asuraaraa ||",
      "translation": "All the gods went to meet Vishnu and said, “ O destroyer of demons  take some steps now.”",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਅਗੋਂ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ) \"ਹੇ ਦੈਂਤਾ ਨੂੰ ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अब कछु करो मंत्र असुरारा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83317",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਸਨੁ ਨਵੀਨ ਕਹਿਯੋ ਬਪੁ ਧਰਿਹੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bisan naveen kahiyo bap dhariho ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੀ) ਕੁਝ ਉਪਾ ਕਰੋ। (ਅੰਤ ਨੂੰ) ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੇ ਕਿਹਾ, \"ਮੈਂ ਹੁਣ ਨਵਾ ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰਾਗਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिसनु नवीन कहियो बपु धरिहो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83318",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗ ਬਿਘਨ ਅਸੁਰਨ ਕੋ ਕਰਿਹੋ ॥੫॥",
      "transliteration": "jag bighan asuran ko kariho ||5||",
      "translation": "Vishnu said, “I shall manifest myself in a new body, and destroy the Yajna of the demons.”5.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦੇ ਯੱਗ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਘਨ ਪਾਵਾਗਾ ॥੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जग बिघन असुरन को करिहो ॥५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83319",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਸਨੁ ਅਧਿਕ ਕੀਨੋ ਇਸਨਾਨਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bisan adhik keeno isanaanaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੇ ਬਹੁਤ (ਤੀਰਥਾ ਦੇ) ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਕੀਤੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिसनु अधिक कीनो इसनाना ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83320",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੀਨੇ ਅਮਿਤ ਦਿਜਨ ਕਹੁ ਦਾਨਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dheene amit dhijan kahu dhaanaa ||",
      "translation": "Vishnu then took bath at various pilgrim-stations, and distributed unlimited alms to the Brahmins.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਬੇਸ਼ੁਮਾਰ ਬ੍ਰਾਹਮਣਾ ਨੂੰ ਦਾਨ ਦਿੱਤੇ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दीने अमित दिजन कहु दाना ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83321",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮਨ ਮੋ ਕਵਲਾ ਸ੍ਰਿਜੋ ਗ੍ਯਾਨਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "man mo kavalaa sirajo gayaanaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ ਗਿਆਨਵਾਨ ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੇ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਗਿਆਨ ਨੂੰ ਵਿਕਸਿਤ ਕੀਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मन मो कवला सृजो ग्याना ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83322",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਾਲ ਪੁਰਖ ਕੋ ਧਰ੍ਯੋ ਧ੍ਯਾਨਾ ॥੬॥",
      "transliteration": "kaal purakh ko dharayo dhayaanaa ||6||",
      "translation": "Brahma, born out of the heart-lotus of Vishnu, propagated the divine knowledge, and Vishnu mediated on the Immanent Lord.6.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ 'ਕਾਲ-ਪੁਰਖ' ਦਾ ਧਿਆਨ ਧਰਿਆ ॥੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "काल पुरख को धर्यो ध्याना ॥६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83323",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਾਲ ਪੁਰਖ ਤਬ ਭਏ ਦਇਆਲਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kaal purakh tab bhe dhiaalaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਦ 'ਕਾਲ-ਪੁਰਖ' ਦਿਆਲੂ ਹੋਏ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "काल पुरख तब भए दइआला ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83324",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਾਸ ਜਾਨ ਕਹ ਬਚਨ ਰਿਸਾਲਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhaas jaan keh bachan risaalaa ||",
      "translation": "The Immanent Lord, then became Merciful and addressed his servant Vishnu with sweet words,",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਵਿਸ਼ਣੁ ਨੂੰ (ਆਪਣਾ) ਦਾਸ ਜਾਣ ਕੇ ਮਿਠੇ ਬਚਨ ਕਹੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दास जान कह बचन रिसाला ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83325",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਧਰੁ ਅਰਹੰਤ ਦੇਵ ਕੋ ਰੂਪਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhar araha(n)t dhev ko roopaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "\"(ਹੇ ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ!) ਤੂੰ ਜਾ ਕੇ ਅਰਹੰਤ ਦੇਵ ਦਾ ਰੂਪ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "धरु अरहंत देव को रूपा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83326",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਸ ਕਰੋ ਅਸੁਰਨ ਕੇ ਭੂਪਾ ॥੭॥",
      "transliteration": "naas karo asuran ke bhoopaa ||7||",
      "translation": "“O Vishnu, manifest yourself in the forms of Arhant, and destroy the kings of the demons.”7.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਜਾ ਕੇ ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਦਾ ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰ ॥੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नास करो असुरन के भूपा ॥७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83327",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਸਨੁ ਦੇਵ ਆਗਿਆ ਜਬ ਪਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bisan dhev aagiaa jab paiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੂੰ ਜਦੋਂ ਆਗਿਆ ਮਿਲੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिसनु देव आगिआ जब पाई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83328",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਾਲ ਪੁਰਖ ਕੀ ਕਰੀ ਬਡਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kaal purakh kee karee baddaiee ||",
      "translation": "Vishnu, after receiving the orders of the Immanent Lord, eulogized him.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤਾ ਉਸੇ ਨੇ) 'ਕਾਲ-ਪੁਰਖ' ਦੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਕੀਤੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "काल पुरख की करी बडाई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83329",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੂ ਅਰਹੰਤ ਦੇਵ ਬਨਿ ਆਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhoo araha(n)t dhev ban aayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਅਰਹੰਤ ਦੇਵ ਬਣ ਕੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਤੇ ਆਇਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भू अरहंत देव बनि आयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83330",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਨਿ ਅਉਰ ਹੀ ਪੰਥ ਚਲਾਯੋ ॥੮॥",
      "transliteration": "aan aaur hee pa(n)th chalaayo ||8||",
      "translation": "He manifested himself as Arhant Dev on the earth and started a new religion.8.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਆ ਕੇ ਹੋਰ ਵੀ ਪੰਥ ਚਲਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ ॥੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आनि अउर ही पंथ चलायो ॥८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83331",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਬ ਅਸੁਰਨ ਕੋ ਭਯੋ ਗੁਰੁ ਆਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jab asuran ko bhayo gur aaiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਦੋਂ (ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਆ ਕੇ) ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦਾ ਗੁਰੂ (ਅਰਹੰਤ ਦੇਵ) ਬਣ ਗਿਆ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जब असुरन को भयो गुरु आई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83332",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁਤ ਭਾਤਿ ਨਿਜ ਮਤਹਿ ਚਲਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahut bhaat nij mateh chalaiee ||",
      "translation": "When he became the preceptor of the demons, he started different kinds of sects.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਾ (ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਬਹੁਤ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਮੱਤ ਨੂੰ ਚਲਾਇਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहुत भाति निज मतहि चलाई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83333",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸ੍ਰਾਵਗ ਮਤ ਉਪਰਾਜਨ ਕੀਆ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sraavag mat uparaajan keeaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਸਰੇਵੜਿਆ ਦਾ ਮੱਤ ਪੈਦਾ ਕੀਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "स्रावग मत उपराजन कीआ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83334",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੰਤ ਸਬੂਹਨ ਕੋ ਸੁਖ ਦੀਆ ॥੯॥",
      "transliteration": "sa(n)t saboohan ko sukh dheeaa ||9||",
      "translation": "One of the sects he started was Shravak sect (Jainism) and bestowed supreme comfort to the saints.9.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਸੰਤਾ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਖ ਪ੍ਰਦਾਨ ਕੀਤਾ ॥੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "संत सबूहन को सुख दीआ ॥९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83335",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਬਹੂੰ ਹਾਥਿ ਮੋਚਨਾ ਦੀਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sabahoo(n) haath mochanaa dhe'ee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਹੱਥਾ ਵਿਚ (ਵਾਲ ਪੁੱਟਣ ਵਾਲੇ) ਮੋਚਨੇ ਫੜਾ ਦਿੱਤੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सबहूँ हाथि मोचना दीए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83336",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਿਖਾ ਹੀਣ ਦਾਨਵ ਬਹੁ ਕੀਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sikhaa heen dhaanav bahu ke'ee ||",
      "translation": "He caused all to hold the forceps for plucking hair and in this way he made many demons devoid of the lock of hair on the crown of the head.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਬਹੁਤੇ ਦੈਂਤਾ ਨੂੰ ਸਿਰ ਤੋਂ ਚੋਟੀ-ਹੀਨ ਕਰ ਦਿੱਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सिखा हीण दानव बहु कीए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83337",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਿਖਾ ਹੀਣ ਕੋਈ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਨ ਫੁਰੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sikhaa heen koiee ma(n)tr na furai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੋਟੀ ਤੋਂ ਹੀਣਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਕੋਈ ਮੰਤਰ ਫੁਰਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सिखा हीण कोई मंत्र न फुरै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83338",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੋ ਕੋਈ ਜਪੈ ਉਲਟ ਤਿਹ ਪਰੈ ॥੧੦॥",
      "transliteration": "jo koiee japai ulaT teh parai ||10||",
      "translation": "Those without hair or without the lock of hair on the crown of their heads could not remember any mantra and if anyone repeated the mantra, there was negative influence of the mantra on him.10.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਜੇ ਕੋਈ (ਮੰਤਰ) ਜਪਦਾ ਹੈ ਤਾ ਉਸ ਦਾ (ਪ੍ਰਭਾਵ) ਉਲਟਾ ਪੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੧੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जो कोई जपै उलट तिह परै ॥१०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83339",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁਰਿ ਜਗ ਕੋ ਕਰਬ ਮਿਟਾਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahur jag ko karab miTaayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ ਉਸ ਨੇ ਯੱਗ ਕਰਨ ਤੋਂ ਰੋਕ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਅਤੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहुरि जग को करब मिटायो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83340",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੀਅ ਹਿੰਸਾ ਤੇ ਸਬਹੂੰ ਹਟਾਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jeea hi(n)saa te sabahoo(n) haTaayo ||",
      "translation": "Then he ended the performance of Yajnas and made all indifferent to the idea of violence on beings.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੀਵ ਮਾਰਨ ਤੋਂ ਸਭਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਹਟਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जीअ हिंसा ते सबहूँ हटायो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83341",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਨੁ ਹਿੰਸਾ ਕੀਅ ਜਗ ਨ ਹੋਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bin hi(n)saa keea jag na hoiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੀਵ ਮਾਰੇ ਬਿਨਾ ਯੱਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋ ਸਕਦਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिनु हिंसा कीअ जग न होई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83342",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਤੇ ਜਗ ਕਰੇ ਨ ਕੋਈ ॥੧੧॥",
      "transliteration": "taa te jag kare na koiee ||11||",
      "translation": "There can be no Yajna without the violence on beings, therefore no one performed Yajna now.11.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਕੋਈ ਯੱਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦਾ ॥੧੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता ते जग करे न कोई ॥११॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83343",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਯਾ ਤੇ ਭਯੋ ਜਗਨ ਕੋ ਨਾਸਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "yaa te bhayo jagan ko naasaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਯੱਗਾ ਦਾ ਨਾਸ਼ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "या ते भयो जगन को नासा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83344",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੋ ਜੀਯ ਹਨੈ ਹੋਇ ਉਪਹਾਸਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jo jeey hanai hoi upahaasaa ||",
      "translation": "In this way, the practice of performing Yajnas was destroyed and anyone who used to kill beings, he was ridiculed.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੇ (ਕੋਈ) ਜੀਵ ਨੂੰ ਮਾਰਦਾ ਹੈ (ਉਸ ਦੀ ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ) ਨਿੰਦਿਆ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जो जीय हनै होइ उपहासा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83345",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੀਅ ਮਰੇ ਬਿਨੁ ਜਗ ਨ ਹੋਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jeea mare bin jag na hoiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੀਵ ਮਾਰੇ ਬਿਨਾ ਯੱਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जीअ मरे बिनु जग न होई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83346",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗ ਕਰੈ ਪਾਵੈ ਨਹੀ ਕੋਈ ॥੧੨॥",
      "transliteration": "jag karai paavai nahee koiee ||12||",
      "translation": "There could be no Yajna without the killing of beings and if one performed a Yajna, he availed no merit.12.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ (ਜੇ ਕੋਈ ਜੀਵ ਨੂੰ ਮਾਰੇ ਬਿਨਾ) ਯੱਗ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਫਲ ਦੀ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦੀ ॥੧੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जग करै पावै नही कोई ॥१२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83347",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਬਿਧਿ ਦੀਯੋ ਸਭਨ ਉਪਦੇਸਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh bidh dheeyo sabhan upadhesaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਸਭਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਉਪਦੇਸ਼ ਦਿੱਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह बिधि दीयो सभन उपदेसा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83348",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗ ਸਕੈ ਕੋ ਕਰ ਨ ਨਰੇਸਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jag sakai ko kar na naresaa ||",
      "translation": "The Arhant incarnation, instructed all in way, that no king could perform a Yajna.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤਾ ਜੋ) ਕੋਈ ਰਾਜਾ ਯੱਗ ਨਾ ਕਰ ਸਕੇ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जग सकै को कर न नरेसा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83349",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਪੰਥ ਪੰਥ ਸਭ ਲੋਗਨ ਲਾਯਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "apa(n)th pa(n)th sabh logan laayaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਗਲਤ ਮਾਰਗ ਉਤੇ ਪਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अपंथ पंथ सभ लोगन लाया ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83350",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਧਰਮ ਕਰਮ ਕੋਊ ਕਰਨ ਨ ਪਾਯਾ ॥੧੩॥",
      "transliteration": "dharam karam kouoo karan na paayaa ||13||",
      "translation": "Everyone was put on a wrong path and no one was performing the action of Dharma.13.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਫਲਸਰੂਪ) ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਧਰਮ ਕਰਮ ਨਾ ਕਰ ਸਕਿਆ ॥੧੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "धरम करम कोऊ करन न पाया ॥१३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83351",
      "sourceShabadId": "7872",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੋਹਰਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhoharaa ||",
      "translation": "DOHRA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੋਹਰਾ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दोहरा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83352",
      "sourceShabadId": "7873",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੰਨਿ ਅੰਨਿ ਤੇ ਹੋਤੁ ਜਿਯੋ ਘਾਸਿ ਘਾਸਿ ਤੇ ਹੋਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "a(n)n a(n)n te hot jiyo ghaas ghaas te hoi ||",
      "translation": "Just as corn is produced from corn, grass from grass",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਵੇਾਂ ਅੰਨ ਤੋਂ ਅੰਨ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਘਾਹ ਤੋਂ ਘਾਹ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अंनि अंनि ते होतु जियो घासि घासि ते होइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83353",
      "sourceShabadId": "7873",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤੈਸੇ ਮਨੁਛ ਮਨੁਛ ਤੇ ਅਵਰੁ ਨ ਕਰਤਾ ਕੋਇ ॥੧੪॥",
      "transliteration": "taise manuchh manuchh te avar na karataa koi ||14||",
      "translation": "In the same way the man from man (thus there is no creator-Ishvara). ||14||",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਿਵੇਾਂ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਤੋਂ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਹੋਰ ਕੋਈ ਕਰਤਾ ਨਹੀਂ ॥੧੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तैसे मनुछ मनुछ ते अवरु न करता कोइ ॥१४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83354",
      "sourceShabadId": "7873",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚੌਪਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chauapiee ||",
      "translation": "CHAUPAI",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੌਪਈ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चौपई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83355",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਐਸ ਗਿਆਨ ਸਬਹੂਨ ਦ੍ਰਿੜਾਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aais giaan sabahoon dhiraRaayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਹੋ ਜਿਹਾ ਗਿਆਨ ਸਭਨਾ ਨੂੰ (ਅਰਹੰਤ ਨੇ) ਦ੍ਰਿੜ੍ਰਹ ਕਰ ਦਿੱਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ऐस गिआन सबहून दृड़ायो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83356",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਧਰਮ ਕਰਮ ਕੋਊ ਕਰਨ ਨ ਪਾਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dharam karam kouoo karan na paayo ||",
      "translation": "Such a knowledge was given to all that none performed the action of Dharma.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਧਰਮ ਕਰਮ ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਨਾ ਕਰ ਸਕਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "धरम करम कोऊ करन न पायो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83357",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਬ੍ਰਿਤ ਬੀਚ ਸਭੋ ਚਿਤ ਦੀਨਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh birat beech sabho chit dheenaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸੇ ਬਿਰਤੀ ਵਿਚ ਸਭਨਾ ਨੇ ਚਿੱਤ ਲਗਾ ਲਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह बृत बीच सभो चित दीना ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83358",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਸੁਰ ਬੰਸ ਤਾ ਤੇ ਭਯੋ ਛੀਨਾ ॥੧੫॥",
      "transliteration": "asur ba(n)s taa te bhayo chheenaa ||15||",
      "translation": "Everyone’s mind was absorbed in such things and in this way, the clan of demons became weak.15.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਲਸਰੂਪ) ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦੀ ਕੁਲ ਬਲਹੀਨ ਹੋ ਗਈ ॥੧੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "असुर बंस ता ते भयो छीना ॥१५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83359",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਹਾਵਨ ਦੈਤ ਨ ਪਾਵੈ ਕੋਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nrahaavan dhait na paavai koiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਦੈਂਤ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦਾ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "न्रहावन दैत न पावै कोई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83360",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਨੁ ਇਸਨਾਨ ਪਵਿਤ੍ਰ ਨ ਹੋਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bin isanaan pavitr na hoiee ||",
      "translation": "Such rules were propagated, that no demon could take a bath now, and without taking bath no one could become pure.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ (ਕੋਈ) ਪਵਿਤਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋ ਸਕਦਾ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 192,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिनु इसनान पवित्र न होई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "83361",
      "sourceShabadId": "7874",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0192_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਨੁ ਪਵਿਤ੍ਰ ਕੋਈ ਫੁਰੇ ਨ ਮੰਤ੍ਰਾ ॥",
